<p>You replace your steamgun and attack with a lightning-charged staff to engage in close combat.</p><p></p><p>Deals 120% steamgun damage as lightning to enemies in a frontal arc, as well as reducing the damage they deal by 3% for 3 turns. This counts as a melee attack but triggers ammunition on-hit effects. All shockstaff attacks will also make a shield slam for the same damage as lightning. </p><p></p><p>You can charge up to your steamgun's range to make shockstaff attacks.</p>